{
  "uid": "foss-errors",
  "title": "Errors & Degraded Mode",
  "description": "What is failing, where, and whether it is a bug or the system correctly refusing. 5xx and 4xx come from the pre-split foss_http_errors_total counter; the two degraded-mode counters are the ones that distinguish 'user has no permission' from 'the authorization engine is down'.",
  "tags": [
    "mechanical-matter",
    "errors"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Three different failures look identical from outside the app, so they are counted separately.\n\n| Counter | Means | Act on it |\n|---|---|---|\n| `foss_http_errors_total{class=\"server\"}` | A 5xx reached the client. A bug. | Read the error log below, follow the trace. |\n| `foss_http_errors_total{class=\"client\"}` | A 4xx. Usually correct refusal — auth, ReBAC, validation. | Ignore unless one route dominates. |\n| `foss_openfga_errors_total` | The authorization engine was unreachable. | **Every check in that window denied.** A resource showing as 'not permitted' here was never actually evaluated. Treat as a security incident, not a permissions bug. |\n| `foss_unhandled_errors_total` | A promise rejected with no handler, or a throw escaped a request. | The originating line never reached a route, so it has no route label here — go to the log stream. |\n\nAny non-zero rate on the last two is degraded mode, not a permissions complaint. `foss_http_errors_total` is split client/server at write time rather than derived from `foss_http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}` so an alert on 5xx stays quiet while a 4xx storm is happening."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx in range",
      "description": "Responses that reached a client as a server error.",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "foss-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "foss-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(increase(foss_http_errors_total{job=\"app\", class=\"server\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
